# Per-Dockerfile ignore for Dockerfile.prefill-worker (BuildKit picks this up in
# preference to a root .dockerignore when building with
# `-f dockerfile/Dockerfile.prefill-worker`). Scoped so it does NOT affect other
# tt-metal image builds.
#
# The worker layers on a prebuilt release base and compiles only the migration
# client from a cloned tt-llm-engine, so NOTHING is read from the build context
# today (no COPY from context, no bind mount). Everything is excluded to keep the
# context transfer at zero — notably tt-metal's ~2 GB .git, which the earlier
# from-source variant of this image had to keep. If a future change does need a
# file from the working tree, un-ignore that path explicitly rather than dropping
# the catch-all.
**
